  "label": "Stereotype of 'Muslim Porn' as a Mocking Reference",
  "description": "The phrase 'Muslim porn' is a deliberately offensive and false stereotype that implies Muslims are somehow associated with pornography, which is a common trope in Islamophobic hate speech. This is not visible in the image but is understood through real-world hate narratives and conspiracy theories that falsely link Muslims to sexual deviance or immorality. The phrase is used here to mock and demean Muslims.",
